{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226700","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226700","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422670001:1":{"text":"在你们到来之前……塔兰河……已经用它的水流……向我传达了鹿灵的指引。","source_cn":"在你们到来之前……塔兰河……已经用它的水流……向我传达...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4248D2B1E7412B74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422670002:1":{"text":"被、被驱逐的子民……需要将远行的躯体……浸入河川当中。","source_cn":"被、被驱逐的子民……需要将远行的躯体……浸入河川当中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5CF5761725BAD5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422670003:1":{"text":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","source_cn":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7899EC27A36E2689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1422670003":{"text":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","source_cn":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7899EC27A36E2689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422670004:1":{"text":"塔兰河……很仁慈……会温柔地托举他的身躯……","source_cn":"塔兰河……很仁慈……会温柔地托举他的身躯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F16B25BFB73221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":